  "_doc": "The Avatar configurator's declaration: the groups the user personalises, their options (a `choice` names a shape the scene in app/src/main/assets/avatar/avatar.js draws; a `color` carries its colour) and the default avatar. Avatar.kt reads it (baked by app/build.gradle as AVATAR_B64); the saved configuration is one option id per group, and an id this file no longer declares falls back to the default.",
